            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Lectern 1.2</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Ask Claude no longer fails with “left 0” on slides whose speaker notes end right before the slide’s closing tag.</li>
  <li>After Claude changes a slide, Keep and Undo now sit in the top bar, so you can look the slide over before deciding.</li>
  <li>Better handling of decks saved with Windows line endings.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
